    "message": "test(installers): assert agent failures are survivable, not fatal\n\nSplits the stops-on-each-failure matrix: uv and Free Claude Code steps still\nassert a hard failure, while every coding-agent step now asserts the opposite\ncontract -- exit 0 with the proxy installed. Also replaces the trailing\ncall-order assertion with an explicit check that fcc-server is verified before\nany coding agent is touched, which is the property that actually matters.",
